# WF Clocks: the clock roster of the `clocks` Android package (org.worldfoundry.game.clocks).
# scripts/pack-clocks-bundle.py packs these levels, in this order, into the package's cd.iff (the
# order is the TOC index); Gradle copies this file into the flavor's assets as levels.manifest,
# where the shared LevelCatalog reads the ids and Dream labels. The index is the TOC position,
# and a saved Dream choice is the id. Keep catalog, menu and bundle order synchronized.
# Format: `level <id>-standalone.iff | <menu name> [| <Dream label>]`; the id is the file name
# without -standalone.iff (wflevels/<id>-standalone.iff must exist).
# Plan: docs/plans/2026-11-21-tide-harbour-clock.md, "The bundle and the chooser" (D2 to D4)
title WF Clocks
prompt Choose a clock
level minute_machine-standalone.iff | Minute Machine | Minute Machine
level tide_harbour-standalone.iff | Tide Harbour | Tide Harbour
level train_loops-standalone.iff | Train Loops | Train Loops
level bamboo_tipper_pond-standalone.iff | Bamboo Tipper and Pond | Bamboo Tipper and Pond
level triple_axis_tourbillon-standalone.iff | Triple-axis Tourbillon | Triple-axis Tourbillon
level cuckoo_village-standalone.iff | Cuckoo Village | Cuckoo Village
level moon_lantern-standalone.iff | Moon Lantern | Moon Lantern
level metronome_forest-standalone.iff | Metronome Forest | Metronome Forest
level lighthouse-standalone.iff | Lighthouse | Lighthouse
level anamorphic_shards-standalone.iff | Anamorphic Shards | Anamorphic Shards
level hour_tree-standalone.iff | Hour Tree | Hour Tree
level corolla_gauge-standalone.iff | The Corolla Gauge | The Corolla Gauge
level dutch_cuckoo_village-standalone.iff | Dutch Cuckoo Village | Dutch Cuckoo Village
level mirror_haze-standalone.iff | Mirror and Haze | Mirror and Haze
level globe_sun_ring-standalone.iff | Globe in a 24-hour Sun Ring | Globe in a 24-hour Sun Ring
level lava_lamp-standalone.iff | Lava lamp | Lava lamp
